#: ../../src/signal.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_signal_t` --- Signal handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_signal_t` —— Signal 句柄"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:7
msgid ""
"Signal handles implement Unix style signal handling on a per-event loop "
"bases."
msgstr "Signal 句柄以每个事件循环为单位实现 Unix 风格的信号处理。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:10
msgid "Windows notes"
msgstr "Windows 说明"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:12
msgid "Reception of some signals is emulated:"
msgstr "某些信号的接收是模拟实现的："

#: ../../src/signal.rst:14
msgid ""
"SIGINT is normally delivered when the user presses CTRL+C. However, like "
"on Unix, it is not generated when terminal raw mode is enabled."
msgstr "用户按下 CTRL+C 时通常会递送 SIGINT。不过，与 Unix 上一样，在启用终端原始模式时不会生成它。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:17
msgid "SIGBREAK is delivered when the user pressed CTRL + BREAK."
msgstr "用户按下 CTRL + BREAK 时会递送 SIGBREAK。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:19
msgid ""
"SIGHUP is generated when the user closes the console window. On SIGHUP "
"the program is given approximately 10 seconds to perform cleanup. After "
"that Windows will unconditionally terminate it."
msgstr "用户关闭控制台窗口时会生成 SIGHUP。在 SIGHUP 发生时，程序会获得大约 10 秒的时间执行清理。此后 Windows 将无条件地终止它。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:23
msgid ""
"SIGWINCH is raised whenever libuv detects that the console has been "
"resized. When a libuv app is running under a console emulator, or when a "
"32-bit libuv app is running on 64-bit system, SIGWINCH will be emulated. "
"In such cases SIGWINCH signals may not always be delivered in a timely "
"manner. For a writable :c:type:`uv_tty_t` handle libuv will only detect "
"size changes when the cursor is moved. When a readable :c:type:`uv_tty_t`"
" handle is used, resizing of the console buffer will be detected only if "
"the handle is in raw mode and is being read."
msgstr "每当 libuv 检测到控制台被调整大小时，都会引发 SIGWINCH。当 libuv 应用运行在控制台模拟器之下，或当 32 位 libuv 应用运行在 64 位系统上时，SIGWINCH 会被模拟。在这些情况下，SIGWINCH 信号不一定总能及时递送。对于可写的 :c:type:`uv_tty_t` 句柄，libuv 只会在光标移动时检测到大小变化。当使用可读的 :c:type:`uv_tty_t` 句柄时，只有在该句柄处于原始模式且正在被读取的情况下，才会检测到控制台缓冲区的大小调整。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:32
msgid ""
"Watchers for other signals can be successfully created, but these signals"
" are never received. These signals are: `SIGILL`, `SIGABRT`, `SIGFPE`, "
"`SIGSEGV`, `SIGTERM` and `SIGKILL.`"
msgstr "可以成功地为其他信号创建监视器，但这些信号永远不会被接收到。这些信号是：`SIGILL`、`SIGABRT`、`SIGFPE`、`SIGSEGV`、`SIGTERM` 和 `SIGKILL.`"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:36
msgid ""
"Calls to raise() or abort() to programmatically raise a signal are not "
"detected by libuv; these will not trigger a signal watcher."
msgstr "通过调用 raise() 或 abort() 以编程方式引发信号，不会被 libuv 检测到；它们不会触发信号监视器。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:39
msgid "SIGWINCH support on Windows was improved."
msgstr "改进了 Windows 上的 SIGWINCH 支持。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:40
msgid ""
"32-bit libuv SIGWINCH support on 64-bit Windows was rolled back to old "
"implementation."
msgstr "64 位 Windows 上 32 位 libuv 的 SIGWINCH 支持被回退到旧实现。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:44
msgid "Unix notes"
msgstr "Unix 说明"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:46
msgid "SIGKILL and SIGSTOP are impossible to catch."
msgstr "SIGKILL 和 SIGSTOP 无法被捕获。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:48
msgid ""
"Handling SIGBUS, SIGFPE, SIGILL or SIGSEGV via libuv results into "
"undefined behavior."
msgstr "通过 libuv 处理 SIGBUS、SIGFPE、SIGILL 或 SIGSEGV 会导致未定义行为。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:50
msgid ""
"SIGABRT will not be caught by libuv if generated by `abort()`, e.g. "
"through `assert()`."
msgstr "如果 SIGABRT 由 `abort()` 生成（例如通过 `assert()`），libuv 将不会捕获它。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:52
msgid ""
"On Linux SIGRT0 and SIGRT1 (signals 32 and 33) are used by the NPTL "
"pthreads library to manage threads. Installing watchers for those signals"
" will lead to unpredictable behavior and is strongly discouraged. Future "
"versions of libuv may simply reject them."
msgstr "在 Linux 上，SIGRT0 和 SIGRT1（信号 32 和 33）被 NPTL pthreads 库用于管理线程。为这些信号安装监视器会导致不可预知的行为，强烈不建议这样做。libuv 的未来版本可能会直接拒绝它们。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:58
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:62
msgid "Signal handle type."
msgstr "Signal 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:66
msgid "Type definition for callback passed to :c:func:`uv_signal_start`."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_signal_start` 的回调的类型定义。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:70
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:74
msgid "Signal being monitored by this handle. Readonly."
msgstr "该句柄正在监视的信号。只读。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:76
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:80
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:84
msgid "Initialize the handle."
msgstr "初始化句柄。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:88
msgid "Start the handle with the given callback, watching for the given signal."
msgstr "以给定的回调启动句柄，监视给定的信号。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:94
msgid ""
"Same functionality as :c:func:`uv_signal_start` but the signal handler is"
" reset the moment the signal is received."
msgstr "功能与 :c:func:`uv_signal_start` 相同，但信号处理函数会在收到信号的那一刻被重置。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:99
msgid "Stop the handle, the callback will no longer be called."
msgstr "停止句柄，回调将不再被调用。"

#: ../../src/signal.rst:101
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

